{{! allcrud-generator: brand-new template, NOT an override of an embedded openapi-generator
    file - the stock "spring" generator has no service-layer template at all (it only emits
    an Api interface + delegate + controller). This file is registered as a per-tag "api
    template file" via CodegenConfig#apiTemplateFiles() in the generation driver code
    (see AllcrudGenerator), with output suffix "Service.java".

    allcrudEntityName / allcrudIdType / allcrudEntityPackage are resolved by
    AllcrudSpringCodegen (a custom CodegenConfig, not the stock "spring" one) - not hardcoded
    here anymore.
    The generated "Repository" class (see repository.mustache) is NOT necessarily a sibling in
    this same package anymore - each of the 5 layers has its own independent target package in
    allcrud-generator.yml's "packages" section, so it's imported explicitly via
    allcrudRepositoryPackage. This used to assume "same package, no import needed", which broke
    the instant a real yml put service/repository in different packages.
    Generated class name is prefixed with allcrudEntityName ("Product"), not the stock
    per-tag classname variable ("ProductsApi", plural, "Api"-suffixed) - that mismatch was
    a naming bug fixed after the fact, not an intentional customization. }}
